WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.200
The kit holds six workflow files.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.009
Two joiners: a pre-hire workflow that
sends the pass seven days before day one,

3
00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:10.825
and a day-one workflow that
requests the onboarding package.

4
00:00:10.825 --> 00:00:12.925
A mover on the organization code.

5
00:00:12.925 --> 00:00:15.877
And three leavers,
including a post-separation

6
00:00:15.877 --> 00:00:18.375
delete thirty days after the leave date.

7
00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:23.000
All of them scope on the employee type
and a worker type code, never on a name.

8
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.947
The day-one workflow
doesn't enable the account;

9
00:00:25.947 --> 00:00:29.650
the pipeline is that writer, as
Chapter 1's register records.

10
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.980
And each file records its version,
owner and execution limit.
